  "steps": [
    "Mix everything well. No water is required; if the mixture feels too dry, add a small splash of water.",
    "Shape into small balls and cook in a paniyaram pan until golden on all sides. You can also air-fry them.",
    "Blend everything until smooth.",
    "Heat 1 tbsp mustard oil in a kadhai. Add 1 tsp jeera, 1 tsp mustard seeds, 1 tsp methi seeds and a pinch of hing.",
    "Once they splutter, add 3 green chillies and curry leaves. Cook for 2–3 minutes.",
    "Add the blended kadhi mixture and 4 more cups of water. Keep stirring until it comes to a boil.",
    "Cover and cook for 20–25 minutes.",
    "Remove the lid, add crushed kasuri methi and mix well. Add the prepared protein pakoras and cook for another 5 minutes.",
    "Heat 2 tsp ghee. Add 2 dried red chillies and 1 tsp Kashmiri red chilli powder. Pour over the kadhi.",
    "Mix well and serve hot with rice!"
  ],
